{
  "name": "Clinic Automation Engine — Your Clinic",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "engine-001",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Clinic Automation Engine — Your Clinic\nEverything is controlled from the clinic's CRM (messages, opening hours, patient list, test mode, on/off switches). **Don't edit messages here.**\n\n**Setup (once):** pick your Twilio + Gmail credential on the 4 marked nodes if they're not pre-filled → Activate → paste the webhook URLs shown in CRM → Settings → Connect into Twilio / your voice agent.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-002",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1 · Win-back campaigns\nThe CRM's **Launch** button calls this. Each eligible patient gets their personalised SMS; every send is logged back to the CRM.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-003",
      "name": "Launch Campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "clinic-launch",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "clinic-launch",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-004",
      "name": "Get Recipients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        240
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://YOUR-CRM-ADDRESS/api/n8n/campaigns/' + $json.body.campaign_id + '/recipients' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "YOUR-CRM-API-KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-005",
      "name": "One Item per Patient",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const r = $input.first().json;\nreturn (r.recipients || []).map(x => ({ json: { ...x, campaign_id: r.campaign.id, campaign: r.campaign.name, demo_mode: r.demo_mode, sms_from: r.sms_from } }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-006",
      "name": "Test Mode?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "combinator": "and",
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-5",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.demo_mode) }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-007",
      "name": "Pretend to Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(i => ({ json: { ...i.json, status: 'demo_sent', sid: 'DEMO' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10).toUpperCase() } }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-008",
      "name": "Send SMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        340
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "from": "={{ $json.sms_from }}",
        "to": "={{ $json.phone }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.message }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-009",
      "name": "Log SMS to CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1140,
        240
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR-CRM-ADDRESS/api/sms",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "YOUR-CRM-API-KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ name: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.name, phone: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.phone, message: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.message, treatment: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.treatment, campaign: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.campaign, campaign_id: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.campaign_id, patient_id: $('One Item per Patient').item.json.patient_id, status: $json.status === 'demo_sent' ? 'demo_sent' : ($json.error ? 'failed' : 'sent'), sent_at: new Date().toISOString() }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-010",
      "name": "Note 10",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2 · Missed calls\nYour phone system calls this when nobody answers (Twilio status callback, or `{\"caller_number\":\"+61…\"}`). The CRM logs the call, looks the caller up, and decides email vs SMS.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-011",
      "name": "Missed Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        700
      ],
      "webhookId": "clinic-missed-call",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "clinic-missed-call",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-012",
      "name": "Was It Missed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const b = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst status = String(b.DialCallStatus || b.CallStatus || b.call_status || '').toLowerCase();\nif (status && !['no-answer', 'busy', 'failed', 'canceled'].includes(status)) return []; // answered → nothing to do\nconst number = b.caller_number || b.From || b.from;\nreturn number ? [{ json: { caller_number: number, caller_name: b.caller_name || b.CallerName || '', at: b.at || b.Timestamp || '' } }] : [];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-013",
